## 6️⃣ Accessibility & SEO

| Tool | Usage |
|------|-------|
| **axe-core** | Run in CI (`npm run lint:accessibility`) |
| **Lighthouse** | Audit in Chrome DevTools or CI |
| **Next.js Head** | Add meta tags, OpenGraph, structured data |
| **React Helmet** | For dynamic meta tags (if needed) |

```tsx
// pages/_app.tsx
import Head from 'next/head';
export default function MyApp({ Component, pageProps }) {
  return (
    <>
      <Head>
        <title>E‑Commerce Store</title>
        <meta name="description" content="Buy the best products online." />
        <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
      </Head>
      <Component {...pageProps} />
    </>
  );
}
```

